ommit a ref pointed to when ls-remote read it; read_at is that instant. The record is stale 60 days after its started_at and is refreshed by re-running the commands in argv.","git ls-remote was first run with several ref patterns per command (HEAD plus refs/tags/... or refs/heads/...); for leanprover/lean4 and postgres/postgres that printed nothing with exit 0. The recorded run uses one pattern per command; the pin for lean4 tags and PR 14577 uses a trailing * pattern, and every matching ref is kept in refs.","refs/pull/14577/merge is not advertised; only refs/pull/14577/head is. The v4.35.0 tag points at eb6cafb7290e8bd5f2937522d8d804f58f02bafc, the commit the bench image's Lean prints in its version string.","Twin cards that name no git repository are not pinned here: Stripe's \"Idempotent requests\" API page, the Zanzibar paper (USENIX ATC 2019), Jepsen's PostgreSQL 12.3 analysis, the arXiv papers on Cedar and CCF, SymCert (FMCAD 2026) and the AWS Automated Reasoning checks pages. Each card states its own read date.","Isabelle is developed in Mercurial; the pin is from its GitHub mirror, isabelle-prover/mirror-isabelle.","input sha256 for each command is the SHA-256 of the lines it printed, joined by newlines with a trailing newline."]}},"facts":{},"checkedBy":[{"run":"RUN-lean-preservation","engine":"lean","version":"4.35.0"},{"run":"RUN-lean-progress","engine":"lean","version":"4.35.0"},{"run":"RUN-twin-pins","engine":"git","version":"2.51.2"}],"unresolved":[],"rev":"bcbceea04054ef9a355cbf6340b22474aa10ed689523bedd426d21e97d8d2b01"}
